## DESIGN SYSTEM (SOURCE OF TRUTH)

### Colors — Use CSS variables only, never hex directly in components

```css
/* Backgrounds */
--color-obsidian:        #0A0A0F   /* Primary background */
--color-deep-space:      #12121A   /* Surface elevation */
--color-midnight:        #1A1A2E   /* Elevated cards */

/* Accents */
--color-electric-cyan:   #00F0FF   /* Primary action, innovation */
--color-plasma-violet:   #7C3AED   /* Secondary, creative work */
--color-solar-gold:      #FFB800   /* Highlights, success states */
--color-circuit-green:   #00FF88   /* Data, AI indicators */

/* Text */
--color-signal-white:    #FAFAFA   /* Primary text on dark */
--color-echo-gray:       #9CA3AF   /* Secondary text */
--color-void-gray:       #374151   /* Borders, dividers */
```

**Color usage rules:**
- Electric Cyan is reserved for primary CTAs and key interactive moments — do not overuse
- Plasma Violet pairs with creative/design service contexts
- Solar Gold only for celebration moments (success states, key metrics)
- Never place Circuit Green next to Electric Cyan (vibration clash)
- All accent colors require 4.5:1 minimum contrast against their background

### Typography

```
Display:  Space Grotesk (500, 600, 700)  — headlines, hero, section titles
Body:     Inter (400, 500, 600)          — paragraphs, nav, UI labels
Mono:     JetBrains Mono (400, 500)      — code, metrics, technical specs
```

**Typography rules:**
- Load fonts via `next/font/google` — never external CDN links
- Use `display: swap` equivalent behavior
- Display font scales: 48px → 64px → 80px → 96px (mobile → wide)
- Body default: 16px mobile, 17px desktop — never below 14px
- Line-height: 1.2 for display, 1.6 for body, 1.5 for UI
- Max line-length for prose: 68 characters

### Spacing — Use the scale, no arbitrary values

```
--space-1:  0.25rem   (4px)
--space-2:  0.5rem    (8px)
--space-3:  0.75rem   (12px)
--space-4:  1rem      (16px)
--space-6:  1.5rem    (24px)
--space-8:  2rem      (32px)
--space-12: 3rem      (48px)
--space-16: 4rem      (64px)
--space-24: 6rem      (96px)
--space-32: 8rem      (128px)
```

**Section vertical padding:** `py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-32`
**Container max-width:** `max-w-7xl` (1280px) with `px-4 md:px-8` gutters

### Border Radius

```
--radius-sm: 0.375rem   — badges, small chips
--radius-md: 0.75rem    — buttons, inputs
--radius-lg: 1.25rem    — cards, panels
--radius-xl: 2rem       — hero containers, feature sections
```

### Motion

```
--duration-fast:    200ms   — hover, focus, micro-interactions
--duration-normal:  400ms   — transitions, reveals
--duration-slow:    800ms   — hero animations, section entrances

--ease-out-expo:    cubic-bezier(0.19, 1, 0.22, 1)
--ease-in-out-quart: cubic-bezier(0.76, 0, 0.24, 1)
```

**Motion rules:**
- Every animation must serve a purpose — never decorative motion without meaning
- Always wrap Framer Motion with `prefers-reduced-motion` checks
- 60fps minimum — if it drops frames, simplify
- One signature motion moment per page maximum (hero, featured work reveal, etc.)
- Page transitions: fade + 8px translate, never slides or scale

