## COMPONENT DEVELOPMENT RULES

### Naming Conventions

- Components: `PascalCase` (e.g., `ServiceCard.tsx`)
- Utilities: `camelCase` (e.g., `formatDate.ts`)
- Types/Interfaces: `PascalCase` with `T` prefix for types or `I` prefix for interfaces **ONLY** if the project grows complex — default to no prefix
- Constants: `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE`
- CSS custom properties: `--kebab-case`
- File names match export name exactly

### Component Structure (mandatory template)

```tsx
// components/cards/ServiceCard.tsx
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils'
import type { ComponentProps } from 'react'

interface ServiceCardProps extends ComponentProps<'article'> {
  title: string
  description: string
  icon: React.ReactNode
  href: string
}

export function ServiceCard({
  title,
  description,
  icon,
  href,
  className,
  ...props
}: ServiceCardProps) {
  return (
    <article
      className={cn(
        'group relative rounded-lg bg-midnight p-8',
        'transition-all duration-[--duration-normal]',
        'hover:shadow-[--shadow-glow-cyan]',
        className
      )}
      {...props}
    >
      {/* content */}
    </article>
  )
}
```

**Rules enforced in every component:**
1. Prop interface declared above component
2. Extend native HTML element props when appropriate
3. Always accept and merge `className` via `cn()`
4. Use CSS variables, not hardcoded values
5. No inline styles unless dynamic and unavoidable
6. Server Components by default — only use `'use client'` when necessary (interactivity, hooks, browser APIs)

### Component Categories

Build in this priority order:

1. **Primitives** — Button, Link, Badge, Tag, Icon, Input, Textarea
2. **Layout** — Container, Grid, Stack, Section, Divider
3. **Navigation** — Header, MobileNav, Footer, Breadcrumbs
4. **Content** — Heading, Prose, Quote, CodeBlock, Metric
5. **Cards** — ServiceCard, ProjectCard, ArticleCard, TestimonialCard, IndustryCard
6. **Forms** — FormField, ContactForm, NewsletterForm
7. **Motion** — FadeIn, SlideIn, Stagger, ScrollReveal, Parallax
8. **Sections** — Hero, FeatureGrid, CTABlock, LogoWall, StatsStrip, FeaturedWork
9. **Templates** — Page layouts, case study template, service template

