## PERFORMANCE BUDGETS

Enforce these in CI via Lighthouse CI:

| Metric | Budget | Failure Mode |
|---|---|---|
| Performance score | ≥ 95 | Block PR |
| Accessibility score | = 100 | Block PR |
| Best Practices score | = 100 | Block PR |
| SEO score | = 100 | Block PR |
| LCP | < 2.0s | Block PR |
| TTI | < 2.5s | Block PR |
| CLS | < 0.05 | Block PR |
| Total JS bundle | < 200KB gzipped | Warn |
| Total CSS bundle | < 40KB gzipped | Warn |

**Optimization priorities:**
1. Server Components first — ship JS only when interactive
2. Route-level code splitting is automatic — don't fight it
3. Lazy load below-the-fold images and components (`next/dynamic` where needed)
4. Preload only critical fonts (2 weights maximum on first paint)
5. Self-host fonts via `next/font` — never external CDNs at runtime

