## SEO REQUIREMENTS

### Every page must have:

- Unique `<title>` (50-60 chars) via `generateMetadata`
- Unique meta description (150-160 chars)
- OpenGraph tags (title, description, image, type, url)
- Twitter Card tags
- Canonical URL
- Appropriate `<h1>` — exactly one per page
- Semantic heading hierarchy (no skipping levels)

### Structured data (JSON-LD)

Implement on relevant pages:

- **All pages:** `Organization` schema
- **Service pages:** `Service` schema
- **Case studies:** `CreativeWork` + `Review` schema
- **Blog posts:** `Article` schema with author
- **Contact page:** `LocalBusiness` schema
- **Homepage:** `WebSite` + `Organization` + search action

### Sitemap & robots

- Dynamic `sitemap.ts` pulling from Sanity + static routes
- `robots.ts` with environment-aware rules (block crawlers on staging)
- Priority and changefreq values reflect actual update cadence

